  "info": {
    "title": "kilncontrol-fixture fixture",
    "version": "0.2.0",
    "description": "Bed-of-nails fixture for the Safe Kiln Controller, drafted by `pinside init` and then reviewed by hand. Directions are set from the schematic's net names: every signal the DUT drives is an observed input, and only the six the DUT reads are driven. The schematic is the authority; see fixture/README.md for what is still open.\n\nJSON-RPC 2.0 over USB CDC, one request per line. The fixture also sends unsolicited notifications: fixture.ready once at start-up, and uart.data for every bus configured to stream.\n\nConfig hash 3db150410419. Compare it against fixture.info before trusting a run."
  },
